# BugOS fakelock - gia verified-boot state o tang property.
#
# Chay o class late_start, KHONG dung `disabled` + trigger.
#
# VI SAO BO `disabled` + `on property:sys.boot_completed=1`:
#   Do tren annibale (A17/OS4.0.6, build 21/11) ca 3 service cua BugOS deu
#   khong chay. Kiem tra cheo tren chinh ROM do: dmesgd, boottrace,
#   aisealhostservice - service CUA ROM, cung dung trigger
#   `on property:sys.boot_completed=1` - cung khong chay (init.svc rong),
#   trong khi gatekeeperd / traced (late_start, KHONG disabled) thi running.
#   => trigger do khong con hieu luc tren ROM nay.
#
# Script TU CHO ca hai thu:
#   - /data/adb/ksud (toi da 90s) - ksud chi co sau khi userdata mount va
#     KernelSU cai userspace
#   - sys.boot_completed (vong while) - framework phai len truoc khi goi
#     `ksud resetprop`
# nen khong can trigger nua, va late_start la dung lop (chay sau khi
# userdata mount xong).
#
# Neu service khong chay, kiem tra:
#   dmesg | grep -E "avc.*bugos|bugos-fakelock"
#   getprop ro.boot.verifiedbootstate
# Service ghi ket qua vao /dev/kmsg voi tag "bugos-fakelock".
service bugos-fakelock /system/bin/sh /system/bin/bugos-fakelock.sh
    class late_start
    user root
    group root system
    oneshot
